{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:30 2026-10-24 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"張偉文疑遭院舍疏忽照顧後最新近況曝光  見一物雙眼發光笑逐顏開\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/a8e35f8450f40ec327d920c2856bda6c/2026-10/KF_cheung.jpg\"/>\n<p>「靚聲王」張偉文近年傳出健康轉差，要入住護老院。早前《星島頭條》獨家披露張偉文疑遭院舍疏忽照顧，長達1年半未曾洗澡，導致全身多處有壓瘡問題，腳部紅腫潰爛。張偉文的監護人兼多年好友方俊，近日在社交平台公開張偉文的最新情況，見到張偉文的身體逐漸好轉。</p>\n<h2>張偉文臉色紅潤</h2>\n<p>方俊於今日（24日）凌晨更新FB，分享張偉文的近照，見到張偉文精神不錯，臉色較以往紅潤，雖然頭髮斑白，身形仍然瘦削，但相比起幾個月前情況有所好轉。方俊在帖文中晒出蛋撻相，張偉文望住食物雙眼發光，笑得燦爛。</p>\n<img alt=\"方俊指張偉文已有長達一年半時間，沒有洗澡及坐起身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/866c77d0b4a9a151473e1164884a265e/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_7_30_20_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"社會福利署早前接獲張偉文在護老院被疏忽照顧的投訴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b78ba298ed4f55db36e071c23c018e2c/2026-04/677007462_10163660043622740_3695312509169816703_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"社署指牌照處在接獲投訴後，已即時展開跟進與調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41fdb397ac2aaba8cf872b8edc60af81/2026-04/677454220_10163660088147740_8092506379447894307_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊今日（24日）凌晨在FB代張偉文報平安。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e8d4de2224277c05fcfc1dbc8dbb39e/2026-10/6586_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文最新照片精神不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b51242c9233d2ac0866e4c9c8df3fd29/2026-10/CHEUNG_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊買蛋撻畀張偉文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61e612f4362b2cd3f45877481e070448/2026-10/CHEUNG_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文9月時的照片，有指胃口及健康狀況良好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a86c676676c0dd956905bd8f69494b9a/2026-10/CHEUNG_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊晒出為張偉文購買尿片的收據。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa2f049dc2e1a565ab47ee54e42d30b0/2026-10/CHEUNG_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有院友家屬透露在院舍內見過張偉文，指他需要由專人餵飯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ab98682ddabdb1d2d3e0564546b57bd0/2026-07/TVB1978_SongContest.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊透露張偉文早已在圈中朋友見證下簽署授權書，委託他處理資產。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49be7b4fead4294d34e2091e1c4d937f/2026-07/699227928_10163743202647740_8253271540882111173_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊（右）接受《星島頭條》訪問，指控張偉文入住的護老院涉嫌長期隱瞞病情，拒絕基本護理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/978e625c8e7314b717209bb3e461ac00/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_7_30_18_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文雙目無神、眼皮下垂，頭髮及鬚根都變白，而且暴瘦20磅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/620f4e20eb961544147301d8e1daaf8e/2025-05/A5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊指張偉文嚴重壓瘡持續惡化。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36a2b19c896565434e7358daea003e7b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_7_30_18_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊指張偉文雙腳有傷，但院方拖延多時都沒有通知家屬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ef1af3a80c3f6378ea2951338d2bc6c9/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_7_30_18_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊日前從外地回港後往護老院探望張偉文，驚見張偉文的雙腳紅腫、瘀黑、皮膚潰爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/838f80a871843c0eb06324f1dceeceff/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_7_30_18_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊向記者展示張偉文傷勢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e981ca0d9d6f05a26a4fafbba6bc4856/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_7_30_19_PM_3__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文情況再轉差。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35b3c5afedbfa74dc72d808e88973e9d/2025-05/A7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊透露張偉文3年兩度「中招」後，身體變差。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/48eb9bfcca0bf66e5413dd29ad954cd5/2025-05/A6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文曾留院多天，病情嚴重。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57f3ef8f5ed77317b73f25162dd91a9e/2025-05/A1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊曾連日到醫院探病。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d546471f255f6c402ba8706c9903c116/2025-05/A2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊關心張偉文情況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7ca59f5b94b092730258ee8004ef7a76/2025-05/A3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊提到張偉文已簽署授權書，委託他在其死後處理身後事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9337048ce2ebb7dfcc226a034c3421f6/2025-05/A4.jpg\"/>\n<h2>張偉文情況樂觀</h2>\n<p>方俊公開張偉文目前的各項身體指標，他透露好友現時精神狀態極佳，情緒亦非常愉快，連胃口都相當不錯。雖然困擾多時的壓瘡問題康復進度依然緩慢，但血糖、血壓和血脂均已回落至正常水平，情況非常樂觀。</p>\n<h2>張偉文未見過兒子</h2>\n<p>73歲的張偉文晚年淒涼，他曾在早年透露一生遺憾，初戀女友當年懷孕四個月，卻離張偉文而去，並攜兒子到美國定居，以至張偉文至今未曾見過親生兒子一面。張偉文雖然惋惜，卻曾表示：「佢哋喺美國幾好，咁我都安樂。個仔根本同我冇乜交往，見到面我諗都好生疏。」</p>\n<img alt=\"張偉文近年傳出健康轉差，體重急跌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/67adb77ea393efc0c4dfb823c06d627e/2026-03/01_2_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文好有「食力」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c50a79c834a3c99500984c4e604e6579/2023-07/IMG-20220509-WA0256.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文近年健康出現問題，方俊一直陪伴在側。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a47591d1f5c25016c5cd4b859b55199a/2023-07/FB_IMG_1687624342185.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文有嘢食就最開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cef2f770e0925a46ff656faa770bb9a0/2023-07/_DSC9439.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文近年身體多次出現不適。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bfe834c42760e2e6f92e5deabad4552e/2023-07/0L8A0082.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文（左）早年擔任和音。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa2a3dc4718dd43d9224362efe1e3767/2024-11/chorusForAndyLau_Singapore.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊曾冒住8號風球到醫院探張偉文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1df5977903fd46b5b356c3747040a423/2023-07/IMG-20230717-WA0171.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文近年經常出入醫院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cd43a0bffae1cee9caee9526480a7306/2023-07/IMG-20230717-WA0172.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文的狀態不如從前。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf5fd0ea715c2181ebad08f65d0b3227/2024-11/muisc927_1732703241_3510491684410383867_12605588472.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊陪張偉文慶祝中秋節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d6e8e003742508fd64682b243f8428e/2024-09/IMG-20240920-WA0041.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊放低手上事務為張偉文抹鼻涕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1aa94baef0f2c8ed688c0f3042a43ce8/2024-09/IMG-20240920-WA0028.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文最愛食雞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3de009fcf8f2cc1f0d4971d9bc5784b0/2024-09/IMG-20240920-WA0024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\" 方俊首支廣東歌《鼓舞》好有鼓勵性。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8abad15b33d4c6c67835f343a5a5d373/2024-09/01__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文為方俊單曲拍MV。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0d7520235d7d53a6e8dfdcc22046504/2024-09/02__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"6年冇做和音嘅張偉文為愛徒出山。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/430d7ffdc761520baf5eca1a9a29214b/2024-09/06_6__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊、姚煒曾為張偉文演唱會做嘉賓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c818154667ac2d44d8230e4b1d9ef527/2024-09/0L6A4996.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張偉文前年在方俊屋企過中秋節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/197f91463291ae7a592c4800718478ff/2024-09/IMG-20220911-WA0021_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方俊曾跟恩師分享獲第一屆《中國寧夏．平羅全國網絡歌手大賽》殿軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0890341be56e74037c076af2f383c4b/2024-09/IMG-20230912-WA0013_0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:42:57.141982+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":495,"images":41,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:30:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:38:46.025778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:38:38.336524+00:00","content_hash":"98bffc8f4411c964448a9d07a01adefb9af01ccbe1c77130f8ab239b2d8afc4b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}